.TH GET_ROBUST_LIST 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
get_robust_list \- Linux x86-64 syscall 274
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_260_299.h>
.B int get_robust_list(pid_t process, void** head, size_t* length);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Queries a thread's Linux robust-futex list.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR get_robust_list (2)
